        "html": "<section data-design-round=\"0001\" style=\"margin:0 auto;width:100%;max-width:64rem;padding:4rem 1.5rem 3rem;font-family:var(--font-mono),ui-monospace,monospace\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:14px;color:var(--accent-muted)\">testuser@sh:~ $ <span style=\"color:var(--accent)\">cat recommendations/*.md</span></p><p style=\"margin:.375rem 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-secondary)\">3 files · quoted verbatim, with permission · newest first</p><p style=\"margin:.375rem 0 0;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-secondary)\"><span style=\"color:var(--accent-muted)\">#</span> design fixture — fictional entries; the data file must hold real quotes</p><ol aria-label=\"recommendations\" style=\"list-style:none;padding:0;margin:2rem 0 0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.75rem\"><li><article style=\"border:1px dashed var(--border);background:var(--secondary-background);padding:1.25rem\"><header style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:.75rem;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"min-width:0;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--text-primary)\">mara-okonkwo<span style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">.md</span></span><time datetime=\"2025-09\" style=\"flex:none;color:var(--text-secondary)\">2025-09</time></header><blockquote style=\"margin:.75rem 0 0;max-width:65ch;padding-left:.75rem;border-left:2px solid var(--accent-muted);font-family:var(--font-sans),ui-sans-serif,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--text-primary)\"><p style=\"margin:0\">Hand him a service nobody wants to touch and he comes back with a smaller one that does the same job and a runbook for the on-call rota. He is the only engineer I've managed who deleted more code than he wrote in a quarter and shipped more because of it.</p></blockquote><footer style=\"margin-top:.75rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;column-gap:.75rem;row-gap:.25rem;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:var(--text-primary)\">— Mara Okonkwo</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">engineering manager @ Lattice Grid</span><a href=\"https://example.com/in/mara-okonkwo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"recommendation from Mara Okonkwo on linkedin (opens in a new tab)\" style=\"margin-left:auto;color:var(--accent-muted)\"><span style=\"color:var(--accent-muted)\">#</span> via linkedin ↗</a></footer></article></li><li><article style=\"border:1px dashed var(--border);background:var(--secondary-background);padding:1.25rem\"><header style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:.75rem;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"min-width:0;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--text-primary)\">devin-alcaraz<span style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">.md</span></span><time datetime=\"2024-11\" style=\"flex:none;color:var(--text-secondary)\">2024-11</time></header><blockquote style=\"margin:.75rem 0 0;max-width:65ch;padding-left:.75rem;border-left:2px solid var(--accent-muted);font-family:var(--font-sans),ui-sans-serif,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--text-primary)\"><p style=\"margin:0\">We hired him for a three-month migration and kept him for two years. The migration finished early; the rest was him fixing things we hadn't noticed were slow.</p></blockquote><footer style=\"margin-top:.75rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;column-gap:.75rem;row-gap:.25rem;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:var(--text-primary)\">— Devin Alcaraz</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">cto @ Northbeam Labs</span></footer></article></li><li><article style=\"border:1px dashed var(--border);background:var(--secondary-background);padding:1.25rem\"><header style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:.75rem;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"min-width:0;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--text-primary)\">priya-raman<span style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">.md</span></span><time datetime=\"2023-06\" style=\"flex:none;color:var(--text-secondary)\">2023-06</time></header><blockquote style=\"margin:.75rem 0 0;max-width:65ch;padding-left:.75rem;border-left:2px solid var(--accent-muted);font-family:var(--font-sans),ui-sans-serif,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--text-primary)\"><p style=\"margin:0\">Clear estimates, boring deploys, and a changelog I could actually send to customers. I'd work with him again without a second quote.</p></blockquote><footer style=\"margin-top:.75rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;column-gap:.75rem;row-gap:.25rem;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:var(--text-primary)\">— Priya Raman</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">freelance client</span><a href=\"https://example.com/testuser/project/issues/42\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"recommendation from Priya Raman on github (opens in a new tab)\" style=\"margin-left:auto;color:var(--accent-muted)\"><span style=\"color:var(--accent-muted)\">#</span> via github ↗</a></footer></article></li></ol></section>"
